  "title": "Lument Finance Trust Announces Quarter-End Earnings Release and Investor Call Dates",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, August 10, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“we,”; “LFT” or “the Company”) announced today that it expects to file its Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Thursday, August 13, 2026, after the market closes, and invites investors and other interested parties",
